<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Freeport says to delist in Australia.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Freeport says to delist in Australia.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freeport-McMoRan Copper &amp; Gold Inc said on Wednesday it will delist its Class A and Class B common stock from the Australian Stock Exchange (ASX), effective November 8, owing to a a lack of liquidity.</p>
<p>The company said almost all Australian interest in its stock was transacted on the New York Stock Exchange and Australian shareholders would be able to arrange for shares to be traded there through ASX member organisations.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
